<content><![CDATA[<p>Design and build a small set of stylized, game-ready props that share a palette and style, and present them in a real-time engine.</p>
<h2>Learning Objectives</h2>
<ol>
<li>Design a cohesive set of props</li>
<li>Build each prop within a polygon budget</li>
<li>Texture the set with a shared palette</li>
<li>Present the set in PlayCanvas</li>
</ol>
